{"version":1,"content":"<p>據最新披露文件顯示，蘋果公司在2026財年通過將約500億美元利潤經由新加坡進行財務安排，成功減少約27億美元税務支出。這一節税規模甚至超過了蘋果長期以來依賴的愛爾蘭架構，使新加坡成為其當前最具成效的國際税務優化中心。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585516.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.538253+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T20:08:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"6858985285b5a03b77c939a490b313e1569253db9b43fdb6ddadb3b69ce5bd85","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}